## Current Phase

**Phase 7 — Document Management**  
Status: **COMPLETE AND VERIFIED**

Phase 7 connects: **Application → Documents**

### Implementation Summary

**Backend - Document Module (`backend/app/modules/documents/`):**
- `router.py` — Full API endpoints (upload, list, checklist, get, presigned URL, download, update, verify, reject, archive/delete)
- `schemas.py` — Pydantic schemas (DocumentResponse, DocumentUpdate, DocumentVerify, DocumentReject, DocumentListResponse, DocumentChecklistRequirement, ApplicationDocumentChecklistResponse, PresignedUrlResponse)
- `service.py` — DocumentService with business logic (CRUD, validation, audit, tenant isolation, checklist calculation, replacement logic)
- `__init__.py` — Module init

**Database:**
- Models: `backend/app/models/service_field.py` (ServiceRequiredDocument), `backend/app/models/document.py` (Document)
- Migration: `0007_create_document_tables.py` — Creates documents table with indexes, FKs, check constraint

**Storage:**
- `backend/app/core/storage.py` — StorageService with MinIO integration (validate_file, detect_mime_type, sanitize_filename, generate_storage_key, presigned URLs, streaming download)

**Security:**
- RBAC permissions: DOCUMENT_VIEW, DOCUMENT_UPLOAD, DOCUMENT_UPDATE, DOCUMENT_VERIFY, DOCUMENT_REJECT, DOCUMENT_DELETE (Owner/Manager only)
- Tenant isolation via shop_id on all queries
- Dual-layer file validation (extension + magic-byte MIME detection)
- Deterministic storage keys: `shops/{shop_id}/applications/{application_id}/documents/{uuid}_{safe_filename}`

**Frontend (`frontend/`):**
- `src/types/document.ts` — TypeScript types matching backend schemas
- `components/documents/document-manager.tsx` — Full Document Manager component with:
  - Service Requirements Checklist with verification status badges
  - Document Upload dialog with file size/type hints
  - Document Preview/Download via presigned URLs
  - Verify Document modal
  - Reject Document modal (mandatory rejection reason)
  - Edit Notes dialog
  - Archive/Delete dialog (soft archive vs hard delete)
  - Additional Documents section for uncategorized uploads
- `app/dashboard/applications/[id]/page.tsx` — Application Detail page with embedded DocumentManager

**Tests (`backend/tests/test_documents.py`):**
- 31 comprehensive async tests covering:
  - Upload document (success, invalid extension, size limit, without required doc, tenant isolation)
  - List documents (with status filter)
  - Application checklist
  - Document details
  - Presigned URL generation
  - Streaming download
  - Update notes
  - Verify document
  - Reject document (with/without mandatory reason)
  - Staff cannot delete document (RBAC)
  - Archive document
  - Hard delete document
  - Document replacement archives previous
  - Audit logs created on upload
  - Invalid required_document_id
  - Wrong service required doc
  - Nonexistent document access

